    (4,0,0,0) . |1> (x) |1> (x) |0> +
    (5,0,0,0) . |1> (x) |1> (x) |1>)^+ .

red (2,0,0,0) . <0| (x) <0| (x) <0| + 
    (3,0,0,0) . <0| (x) <0| (x) <1| + 
    (4,0,0,0) . <0| (x) <1| (x) <0| + 
